window.products.push({"id":906006,"name":"Destiny Anti-slip Handle and Anti-splash Lid Combo (Teal) for YETI Rambler 30 Oz Tumblers, with Bonus Aluminum Carabiner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7144bFDCKXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Destiny Handle & Lid for Yeti Tumblers. The Best Tumbler Accessories You can Ever Have! If you own a 30oz Yeti type stainless steel tumbler, you need this yeti handle&lid combo to make it complete. 4 Reasons why you need Destiny Handle & Lid combo Fed up with dropping your 30 oz tumbler? Want to hold your tumbler without both hands? Worry about your beverage splashing? Want to hook your tumbler to backpack while camping/hiking? Double Ring Handle: Slides up the two ring design handle onto your tumbler, you will find it holds your tumbler very snugly and securely. Drinking with the handle makes using the tumbler much more enjoyable. Anti-splash Replacement Lid: With a sliding closure, the lid can be open or closed, fits your straws and seals your 30oz tumblers very well, keeps your drinks from splashing out of the cup and keeps bugs from getting inside of your tumbler if you are outside with it, espectially when you're driving. After attached the handle and lid, your tumbler still perfectly fits for your car cup holder. Bonus Aluminum Carabiner We offer a nice solid aluminum carabiner with a safety screw & spring clip, attach it to your backpack and take your Yeti mug outdoor. What mugs Does it Fit For? Destiny Handle & Lid set perfectly fits the YETI rambler tumbler, RTIC, SIC Glacier, Ozark Trail, Grid Gear, Eskimo, Thermik, Ozark, Magnum Steel, Kodiak, Boss, Polar Drifter, Engel, Titan, Polar Pad, Smart, ICONIQ, Epic, Bison, K2, Smart, Zero, Kryo Kup, Iceberg and Frosti tumblers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7144bFDCKXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Destiny&MM","source_asin":"B01MSSRQ5X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-906006","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MSSRQ5X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MSSRQ5X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":906007,"name":"Mila 3D Frameless Wall Clock Large DIY Wall Sticker Decorations for Living Room Bedroom Office (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HFv-dlbcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"1.Stickers Made of EVA Foam Material and Mirror Material, Which is Non Toxic and Non Fading, Can Last for About 3-5 Years. 2.Stickers Can be Removable ,With Glue on The Backside, Easy to Paste on The Wall or Any Other Clean and Smooth Surface; Such As door ,the closet and so on 3.The mirror with glue, before to paste the sticker on the wall, you need to paste the mirror on the sticker surface first 4. DIY design, clock layout size measured by hands, can be ajust to be smaller or bigger size this is a 3D DIY wall clock,very nice one,high quality one. Sticker Material: EVA Foam (Ethylene vinyl acetate) Clock Material: Metal, EVA, Mirror Hour Hand: 27.5cm Minute Hand: 33.5cm Clock Machine: 10cm Battery:1.5V AA battery 1 piece(without) The minimum achieving is: 63cm x 63cm. Montage size:120X120CM The clock final decoration size is decided by how you want to decorate you walls. Choose color:Black Silver Gold Red (has Mirror Acrylic) Packing: 1x Clock stickers 1x Clock mechanism Without battery How to Install? STEP1:Fasten the clock movement on the wall STEP2:peel off protection film from mirror,stick it on the EVA number.Cover the clock movement with the auxiliary scale,stick the numbers at the right site according to the scale. STEP3:Take down the clock movement,fixing the hour hand ,then minute hand.Tips:press the clock hands into the clock axle and point at 12 o'clock. STEP4:Adjust the time by button on the clock movement and install the battery. STEP5:Hanging the clock movement on the wall. STEP6:Well done!You can enjoy your art-work now(No retail packaging)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HFv-dlbcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mila","source_asin":"B07YNKDHJK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-906007","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YNKDHJK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YNKDHJK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
