window.products.push({"id":906148,"name":"Cork Genius Wine-Saving Vacuum Sealers - Pocket-Sized, Vacuum Sealers for Wine Bottles - Airtight Wine Sealers for Saving Wine - Leak and Spill Resist","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E-VdVNDkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LEAK AND SPILL-FREE WINE SAVING - With Cork Genius vacuum sealers, you can make any bottle of wine bottles both leak and spill resistant. With a few quick pumps, you'll completely seal your wine for later enjoyment. SAVE, PRESERVE, AND PROTECT ALL YOUR FAVORITE WINES - Unlike traditional wine stoppers and wine corks, with the Cork Genius airtight wine sealers, you'll achieve optimal wine preservation for all your favorite unfinished bottles of wine for weeks at a time. With one easy-to-use vacuum sealer, you'll put a stop to unnecessary wine spoilage once and for all. MORE THAN JUST A WINE SEALER - Store all of your favorite sealed wines sideways whenever you need space. The air-tight seal prevents any kind of leaks or spills, making them perfect for picnicking, traveling, horizontal storage, entertaining, or personal use at home. USDA-APPROVED FOOD SAFE MATERIALS - All of the Cork Genius vacuum seal wine sealers are created using premium and professional USDA-approved food safe materials. Enjoy and use your new vacuum wine sealer set for both home and professional serving settings. TAKE THEM ANYWHERE - With a small and compact design, you can easily take your wine vacuum sealer everywhere you go without taking up valuable space in storage bags or bins.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E-VdVNDkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CORK GENIUS","source_asin":"B09K4JBT1W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-906148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K4JBT1W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K4JBT1W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
