window.products.push({"id":906235,"name":"STRATA CUPS SKINNY TUMBLERS (4 pack) 16oz Matte Lilac Colored Acrylic Tumblers with Lids and Straws | Double Wall Plastic Tumbler With Lid and Straw b","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ufz-YK8cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ COLD DRINKS STAY COLD! And warm drinks stay warm! Forget about single-walled tumbler. Sure, they can hold a drink, but sooner or later you’ll wish that cold drink hadn’t gone warm, or left condensation rings all over your surface. STRATA Insulated tumbler with their double walls, thermo-regulate your drinks so you can enjoy them down to the last refreshing drop. ✅4 FUN PASTEL COLORS: Got 4 kids? No? You will when you bring these out at parties. Watch how even the most serious adult eyeballs their favorite color, hoping that someone else doesn’t grab it first. Obviously color-coding is a great way to stop someone stealing your drink, and a must-have for allergy sufferers. ✅ SPLASH-PROOF LIDS: Most acrylic tumblers with straw come with a rubber push down lid, and when you drop them the lid pops off. Each Strata tumbler pack come with colored screw top lids with tight straw seal. While we can’t say a few drops won’t escape, we can say you won’t be cleaning up a giant orange juice mess from your carpet. ✅ EASY TO CLEAN: Cracked plastic and water getting into the double walls are real concerns when it comes to cleaning an acrylic clear tumbler. So our design team solved both problems. Your tumblers are 100% Handwash Only. They also come with a BONUS STRAW CLEANER so so you can keep straws spotless inside and out. ✅ SATISFYING TO GRIP: Many people agree skinny tumblers with straw are the most comfortable size to hold. Not only do they feel good, they’re easier for kids, and folks with arthritic hands. Each tumbler is 8.5” high with a 2.5” diameter, and holds 16oz of your favorite beverage. BPA FREE, Non-Toxic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ufz-YK8cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STRATA CUPS","source_asin":"B08LG74YCP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-906235","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LG74YCP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LG74YCP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
