window.products.push({"id":906374,"name":"Vman Springform Cake Pans Set - 3 Piece 4\" 7\" 9\" Cheesecake Pans, Icing Spatula and Icing Smoother, Durable Non-stick Leakproof Bakeware Cake Pan Set ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712roax+92L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why Should You Choose This Item? √ The pans is made from durable carbon steel that can bake over and over again with the same great results. BPA free.√ Coated in long-lasting nonstick for excellent food release and easy cleanup.√ Vman springform pan is oven safe to 450 degrees.√ It's leak-proof and will not melt or warp under extreme heat in your oven. √ Removable bottom for you to remove the delicate cakes easily.√ 3 Size Springform Pans, Bakeware for Every Day and Every Occasion.√ Designed for making layer cakes, cheesecake, chiffon cake, sponge cake etc delicious food, perfect birthday gift, holiday present.√ The icing smoother is made of aluminum. Used to create designs on the side or top of cakes, and also used to smooth icing in preparation for decorating.√ The icing spatula is made of stainless steel, designed for flexibility, gives you better control and dexterity for a beautifully decorated cake, cupcake or dessert. Use and Care Suggests: 1. Please don't use sharp utensil to scratch the surface.2. Please make sure the bottom pan is right way for fixing on the groove, otherweise the ingredients will leak.3. Please use nylon or wooden utensils for non-stick bakeware. Never cut or chop with metal utensil.4. Please hand wash only after your use. And choose soft tools and mild detergent when you clean it to protect non-stick coating.5. Please don't pour water onto a hot pan, the excess residue may splatter and cause the pan to warp. Specifications: Material: Duarable carbon steel Color: Black Shape: Round Size: 4 + 7 + 9 in (3 piece in a set) Weight: 1.65lb With removable bottom and quick-release latch Package Include: 1X 4 inch springform pan1X 7 inch springform pan1X 9 inch springform pan1X icing spatula1X icing smoother","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712roax+92L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vman","source_asin":"B07VK7C3LR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-906374","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VK7C3LR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VK7C3LR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
