window.products.push({"id":906648,"name":"Easy Removal Metal Ice Trays with Handle - Stainless Steel Ice Cube Maker and stand, 36 Slot Mold - BPA-Free, Food-Grade Freezer Molds for Baby Food, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81m1TEPbsbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VINTAGE​ ​DESIGN, ​MODERN​ TECHNOLOGY: ​Just because you don’t have a fancy, automated ice maker doesn’t mean you have to live with the frustration that anyone who manually makes their ice is familiar with. You know the struggle - waiting forever for the water to freeze and then trying to manhandle it out of the flimsy tray. With the Icenator, you can go from water to refreshingly cold drinks quickly and effortlessly. EASY-RELEASE MECHANISM: This four-piece ice freezer tray with lever comes with a tray and a separator. The separator sits in the tray to create 36 individual ice molds. Fill the tray 3/4th full, do not over fill. Once frozen, thaw for five minutes, for instant results run water over the top & bottom of the Tray before cracking the ice. Gently pull the lever to break the Ice. No need for bending or pushing to manoeuvre the ice out of their slots. Each cube comes out perfectly. QUICKER FREEZING, SLOWER MELTING​: ​Comprised of 304 stainless steel, opting for the Icenator over silicone or plastic ice cube racks means a more efficient freezing process. Stainless steel gets much colder, much faster, than other materials, so it escalates the speed of which water freezes. Furthermore, it retains that cold temperature for longer periods of time, so you can leave these trays out without the ice melting as quickly as it would otherwise. ECO-FRIENDLY, USER-FRIENDLY, DISHWASHER-FRIENDLY​: Because our ice tray holders don’t require electricity and aren’t made from environmentally-hazardous material, utilizing them contributes to helping preserve Mother Earth. Compact, stackable and easy-fill, these ice tray makers are great for mini fridges, dorm rooms, parties, mancaves, and any refrigerator or freezer without an automated ice machine. In between uses, throw them in the dishwasher for an easy clean MAKE MORE THAN JUST ICE: ​The Icenator doesn’t just make ice cubes; this multifunctional ice holder can create a variety of delicious molds for every occasion. Use them for baby and toddler food (ideal for teething babies or for on-the-go food you want staying cold for longer periods of time.) You can also freeze juice or fruit to add to your favorite, summer beverages or alcoholic drinks. With so many fun things you can do with this cube tray with handle, it’s a kitchenware accessory must","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81m1TEPbsbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"O GLOBAL QUEST","source_asin":"B09K2KNQBB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-906648","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K2KNQBB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K2KNQBB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
