window.products.push({"id":906728,"name":"INMAN Floating Shelves, Wall Mounted Nursery Shelf-Wood Bookshelf Wall Shelves for Kitchen Spice Rack Bedroom and Living Room Baby Nursery Decor, 31.5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Yqy-lZ3VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MODERN WOOD SHELVES - INMAN keep using natural wood. Our nursery shelves are very well made of natural oak wood, which is healthy and eco-friendly, also better protect the wood itself with long service life. Offering a super quality and a high-end design. Double up your floor space and create a photo collage without damaging walls all over your home. SPACE SAVING WALL SHELF - Unleash your creativity with this wall shelf. You can place it in your child's bedroom as a space-saving bookshelf or use it as a spice rack or condiment stand in the kitchen. Also can put it in the bathroom to store shampoo, conditioner, face wash, body soap, toothpaste, toothbrush, and other toiletry essentials. STURDY YET DURABLE - Strong and heavy duty, much thicker than regular shelves and can holds up to 48 lbs each shelf. 5 sizes available, length 16’’/20''/24’’/27.5’’/31.5'' and width 4.3’’, can meet various size demand. With simple organization, you can find everything easily at arm’s length. EASY TO INSTALL - It’s a piece of cake to install on your own. Basic wall mounting screws and anchors are already included in this floating shelves. Wall mount for quick change, repeated disassembly use that easily move it when relocating your home. Let's assemble this item into different style according to your needs and innovative imagination to enjoy the fun of DIY! IDEAL FOR HOME DECOR - This kids room organizer looks amazing in any room, complementing your interior by displaying your books, photos, CDs, etc. Give this superb home décor piece to your friends and family members who love to keep everything organized.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Yqy-lZ3VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INMAN","source_asin":"B08HN9K7FT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-906728","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HN9K7FT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HN9K7FT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
