window.products.push({"id":906853,"name":"Air Fryer Rack for Double Basket Air Fryers, Stainless Steel Multi-Layer Rack of Air Fryer Accessories Non-Stick Mini Tins Compatible with Dual Basket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UBtYJhWZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍕【Premium material】The air fryer three-tier rack is made of high-quality food-grade 304 stainless steel, which is safe, non-toxic and durable, preventing rust and corrosion caused by the external environment with high temperature resistance, allowing you to enjoy healthy food without worry. 🍕【New Design】The multi-functional air fryer rack specially designed for Ninja air fryer. You can bake delicious toast, steak, roast meat with this air fryer 3 rack, while making vegetables and toppings in another air fryer basket of the air fryer machine, saving time and enjoying hot food quickly! 🍕【Quick Dehydration】The unique three-layer dehydration rack design can quickly dehydrate various foods and lock in the nutrients,, allowing you to enjoy various dehydrated fruits or dehydrated beef jerky conveniently and quickly. 🍕【Compatible Air Fryers】The triple air fryer stand is compatible for Ninja Dual Zone Air Fryer and other dual zone air fryers. Can give them more functionality when making food. Easy to put in and take out during use, The frame of the entire dehydrator rack has been carefully polished without burrs, it is safe to use and feels excellent, and the dishwasher-safe design makes cleaning a breeze. 🍕【Operation Process】When using the air fryer three-layer rack, put the air fryer basket vertically and slowly push the air fryer basket to avoid food falling. You can also use it as an air fryer grill rack for grilling steaks or use it for steaming. Before using the air fryer, please choose the number of layers of air fryer rack you use according to your needs. Might not have to use three layers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UBtYJhWZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SwellishColor","source_asin":"B09W21BRW1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-906853","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W21BRW1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W21BRW1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
