window.products.push({"id":906872,"name":"African American Canvas Prints Black Woman Portrait Photography with Gold Accents Wall Art Posters Decoration for Home Office Decor(12x16 Inches, Unfr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oHlgYZBML._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"These are nice posters look good in a home or office setting. Beautiful wall art and pesfect gift. It represents blessing, love and Promise. They are a simple but sensual pictures. It’s ready to use with your favorite picture frame to bring instant home decor style into any room in your house. It's also beautiful to hang as a poster with no need for addtional frame. Our fashion art print is artistic and stylish which can brighten up your empty walls and create fashion environment.Work great for home decoration,wall decor,girls gifts, bedroom and living room wall decoration. 【Giglee prints:】 Giclee is a method of reproducing art through a printing process very similar to modern ink-jet printers. It has become a very popular method of creating limited edition fine art reproductions. Giglee prints can be printed on a number of different media -- watercolors can be reproduced on watercolor paper, for instance, and can be so color-true that they are virtually indistinguishable from the original. Oil paintings can be reproduced on canvas. Because there is no 'plate' as in standard printing processes, the artwork can be scaled up or down in size, limited only by the physical limitations of the giclee printing machinery.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oHlgYZBML._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BPNHNA","source_asin":"B088DQTFZB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-906872","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088DQTFZB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088DQTFZB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
